      "claim": "Particles whose settling velocity exceeds the reduced flow velocity will settle out of the water column.",
      "evidence": "When flow velocity < particle settling velocity, particles deposit; illustrated by the Hjulström curve where lower velocities shift particles from transport to deposition.",
